  "releaseNotes": "v.1.0.0-preview.88\n- Feature: Introduced support for Playwright-based visual regression testing (VRT). A Storybook-compatible Story Index API is now available at `window.BlazingStory.getStoryIndex()`, allowing Playwright test scripts to enumerate all stories programmatically.\n- Fix: Resolved incorrect preview area sizing that caused VRT screenshots to capture unexpected bounds.\n- Fix: Resolved a timing issue where VRT screenshots could be captured before the initial render completed.\n\nTo see all the change logs, please visit the following URL.\n- https://github.com/jsakamoto/BlazingStory/blob/main/RELEASE-NOTES.txt",
